      172  According to the [[2006 Transnistrian independence referendum|2006 referendum]], carried out by the PMR government, 97.2% of the population voted in favour of "independence from Moldova and free association with Russia". EU and several other countries refused to recognise the referendum results.
      173  Residents had the opportunity to vote in Moldova's referendum on joining the EU, [[2024 Moldovan European Union membership constitutional referendum|in autumn 2024]]. There were no voting stations within Transnistria; however, residents were free to travel into other areas of Moldova to vote. {{cite
